OL,3,GNEWSAMultimillion-pound facilities open
OL,4,Aat college
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey education provider said it is
OL,7,Fmarking the "beginning of a new
OL,8,Fchapter" as it opens new facilities.
OL,10,FMerrist Wood College and University
OL,11,FCentre, which offers specialist courses
OL,12,Fin land-based sectors like agriculture
OL,13,Fand conservation, will unveil two new
OL,14,Fbuildings on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThey form part of a major redevelopment
OL,17,Fof its campus near Guildford, funded
OL,18,Fwith #21m from the Department for
OL,19,FEducation.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
